# §282d: EAS archive = ONLY mobile/ (allowlist). EAS CLI archives from
# the Git root and, when a root .easignore exists, ignores ALL .gitignore
# files. The earlier blacklist still allowed unrelated root/runtime files;
# the observed 97.5 MB upload is proof of archive bloat, but NOT proof of
# what those files were. This allowlist excludes everything at repo root
# except mobile/. The trailing-slash-free !/mobile is deliberate: eas-cli's
# fs.cp filter tests the directory as the path "mobile" (no slash); the
# !/mobile/ form would still exclude that directory and its entire tree.
/*
!/mobile

# Keep secrets, generated outputs and install artifacts out of the mobile
# project too. eas-cli also excludes node_modules and .git by default.
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
coverage/
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
